  offerLine: You, foraging? With those feet? Go on then. Six trips. I'll be watching. You won't see me. Nobody ever sees me.
  activeLine: I saw you out there. Terrible. Keep going.
  readyLine: Not bad. For a gecko. I'm not coming with you, mind. Yet. Here, take these rocks. Don't ask whose garden they're from. I'll tell you a secret, too, if you've got something shiny.
  doneLine: Got anything shiny on you?
